  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]  [A]\n[Dm]  [A]\n[Dm]  [Dm/E]  [Dm/F]  [Dm/G]\n[A]Guess\n\n[Verse 1]\n[A]mine is not the [C#m]first heart\n[D]broken My\n[Bm7]eyes are not the [E7]first to\n[Amaj7]cry [A6]\n[Aadd9]I'm not the first to know [F#7]There's\n[A7/G]just no getting [F#7]over\n[Bm7]you\n[C#m][Bm7][Bm7/E]You\n[A]know, I'm just a [C#m]fool who's\n[D]willing To\n[Bm7]sit around [E7]and wait for\n[Amaj7]you [A6]But\n[Aadd9]baby, can't you [F#7]see There's\n[A7/G]nothing else for [F#7]me to\n[Bm7]do? I'm\n[C#m]hopelessly [Bm7]devoted [Bm7/E]\n[Dm]to you [Dm/E][Dm/F][Dm/G]\n[A]But now there's\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gm7]nowhere to hide Since you\npushed my love aside [C7][Caug]I'm\n[F]out of my [Fmaj7]head\n[Adim7]Hopelessly [D7]devoted\n[Gm7]to you\nHopelessly [C7b9]devoted\n[D]to you [Dm/C#]\n[Dm/C]  [Bm7b5]\n[Gm7]Hopelessly [C7]devoted\n[Dm]to you [Dm/E][Dm/F][Dm/G]\n[A]My\n\n[Verse 2]\n[A]head is saying, [C#m]\"Fool,\n[D]forget him\" My\n[Bm7]heart is saying, [E7]\"Don't let\n[Amaj7]go [A6]\n[Aadd9]Hold on till the [F#7]end\" And\n[A7/G]that's what I [F#7]intend to\n[Bm7]do I'm\n[C#m]hopelessly [Bm7]devoted [Bm7/E]\n[Dm]to you [Dm/E][Dm/F][Dm/G]\n[A]But now there's\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gm7]nowhere to hide Since you\npushed my love aside [C7][Caug]I'm\n[F]out of my [Fmaj7]head\n[Adim7]Hopelessly [D7]devoted to\n[Gm7]you\nHopelessly [C7b9]devoted\n[D]to you [Dm/C#]\n[Dm/C]  [Bm7b5]\n[Gm7]Hopelessly [C7]devoted\n[Bbm]to you [Bbm/C][Bbm/Db][Bbm/Eb]\n[F]",
